---
/**
 * Legacy URL: /featured-project-dos-vientos-villa/ (WP page ID 168).
 *
 * The third featured project. It was invisible to the previous build — the page
 * was never recovered from cache — and it is the only residential showcase of
 * the three, which is exactly what a homeowner arriving from a search for
 * "stone retaining wall Newbury Park" needs to see. The two ballfields prove
 * scale; this one proves it happens at a house.
 *
 * The copy is the owner's, section for section, from the recovered page.
 *
 * IMAGES: the original page linked the outdoor-kitchen shots as 400x300
 * hard-crops. The full-size originals were still in the media library filed
 * under 2016/01 rather than 2016/04, so this page carries the same photographs
 * at 1024px — and five more of them that the old page never showed.
 */
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import Img from '../components/Img.astro';
import { A } from '../lib/assets';
import { SITE_URL } from '../lib/site';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';

const description =
  'Dos Vientos Villa, Newbury Park: a full residential exterior remodel by CPF — stamped concrete driveway, custom stone retaining walls and pillars, a stone-pillared patio enclosure and a serpentine tiled outdoor kitchen with pizza oven.';

/** Front yard, patio, outdoor kitchen — the three areas the job was organised around. */
const sections = [
  {
    id: 'front-yard',
    heading: 'The Front Yard',
    body: `The initial design is centered around the unique look of the stamped concrete
      driveway. The villa is then framed by the custom stone retaining walls punctuated
      by smooth boulders. The stone pillars draw the eye up to the custom stone, full
      size walls surrounding the gate. Stamped concrete and stone accents pour out into
      the sidewalk to truly utilize the available space.`,
    /* The header already carries the driveway-and-gate shot; these are the rest
       of the front yard, including the sidewalk accents the copy describes. */
    images: [
      A.stoneRetainingWallAndStampedConcreteDriveway,
      A.closeUpWallWithCreativeStoneFeatures,
      A.customStoneWallsAndVeneerFeatures,
      A.customConcreteDrivewayWithStoneSidewalkFeatures,
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'patio',
    heading: 'The Patio',
    body: `The client wanted to combine their love for entertaining with the outdoors.
      The patio design allows the client to host in an intimate setting in any climate.
      Custom stone walkways set the tone for the design. The patio is enclosed by custom
      stone pillars and glass wall enclosure, supporting the retractable awning. This
      set up affords the option to experience the lovely California sun while blocking
      any potential wind.`,
    images: [
      A.dosVientosCoveredPatioStonePillars,
      A.dosVientosPatioFountainSeating,
      A.dosVientosPatioEnclosureAwning,
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'outdoor-kitchen',
    heading: 'The Outdoor Kitchen',
    body: `Any host's dream. The custom BBQ kitchen features tiled counter tops and trim
      details. The custom details include the integrated ice chest and drink cooler,
      built in refrigerated storage, sinks, propane barbecue and stove top — all built
      upon a CPF Masonry designed stone patio.`,
    images: [
      A.dosVientosOutdoorKitchenTiledCounter,
      A.dosVientosBuiltInPizzaOven,
      A.dosVientosBarbecueAndRefrigeratedStorage,
      A.dosVientosSerpentineTiledCountertop,
      A.dosVientosOutdoorKitchenCornerView,
    ],
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Dos Vientos Villa"
  description={description}
  extraSchema={[
    {
      '@type': 'CreativeWork',
      name: 'Dos Vientos Villa',
      about:
        'Residential exterior remodel: stamped concrete driveway, custom stone retaining walls and pillars, stone-pillared patio enclosure and a custom tiled outdoor kitchen.',
      creator: { '@id': `${SITE_URL}/#business` },
      locationCreated: { '@type': 'Place', name: 'Dos Vientos, Newbury Park, CA' },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Featured Work', item: `${SITE_URL}/featured-work/` },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Dos Vientos Villa' },
      ],
    },
  ]}
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Featured project · Residential"
    title="Dos Vientos Villa"
    intro="A prime example of CPF Masonry's capabilities for an exterior residential remodel. This job primarily focused on three areas: the front yard, the patio, and the outdoor kitchen."
    asset={A.dosVientosStampedDrivewayStoneWalls}
    displayW={1024}
  />

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-16 sm:px-6 prose-cpf">
    <p>
      Dos Vientos Villa is the residential counterpart to the two ballfield
      projects: one house, one client, and every trade CPF offers turned on the
      same address at the same time. The
      <a href={withBase('/grading-and-excavation/')}>grading</a>, the
      <a href={withBase('/custom-concrete/')}>stamped concrete</a>, the
      <a href={withBase('/stonework/')}>stonework</a> and the
      <a href={withBase('/fireplaces-and-barbecues/')}>outdoor kitchen</a> were
      one job rather than four contractors, which is the reason the driveway, the
      sidewalk accents and the wall line all resolve against each other.
    </p>
  </article>

  {
    sections.map((section, si) => (
      <section id={section.id} class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl prose-cpf">
          <h2>{section.heading}</h2>
          <p>{section.body}</p>
        </div>

        <ul class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          {section.images.map((asset, i) => (
            <li>
              <Img
                asset={asset}
                displayW={500}
                sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw"
                label={`Dos Vientos ${section.id} ${i}`}
                lightbox
                imgClass="aspect-[3/2] w-full object-cover"
              />
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>
    ))
  }

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 prose-cpf">
    <p>
      This CPF Masonry remodel gave the home its own identity in the
      neighborhood. The attention to detail in the design took a solid house and
      made it an extraordinary home.
    </p>
  </article>

  <CtaBand
    heading="Schedule an estimate"
    body="Contact us to schedule an estimate and discuss how we can accommodate your needs."
  />
</Layout>
